WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.241 --> 00:00:21.618
Hey. I'm your Dot.

00:00:21.618 --> 00:00:24.162
I'm new in ChatGPT.

00:00:24.162 --> 00:00:27.081
I'll be here to handle everything
that comes your way.

00:00:27.081 --> 00:00:30.084
Ready to jump in when you need me.

00:00:30.209 --> 00:00:31.586
I'm going to call you...

00:00:31.586 --> 00:00:32.920
I'm going to call you Alfred.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:33.504
You got it!

00:00:33.504 --> 00:00:35.298
I'm Alfred.

00:00:35.298 --> 00:00:39.177
I'll keep things moving and check in when
something important needs your approval.

00:00:39.218 --> 00:00:40.762
Love it. Let's get to work.

00:00:40.762 --> 00:00:43.264
I've been getting your website ready
for the fall launch

00:00:43.264 --> 00:00:44.641
using your approved designs.

00:00:44.641 --> 00:00:46.100
Okay, perfect.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.936
The latest consumer experience
numbers came in on Teams.

00:00:48.936 --> 00:00:50.688
I've been updating your board
meeting deck.

00:00:50.688 --> 00:00:51.773
Sounds good.

00:00:51.773 --> 00:00:54.776
So I caught the app migration in your Google
Meet notes.

00:00:54.817 --> 00:00:56.611
I've already mapped out the changes.

00:00:56.611 --> 00:00:59.572
Get it started,
but make sure you first check

00:00:59.572 --> 00:01:02.867
every flow against the current
product before I review.

00:01:04.077 --> 00:01:06.204
Also, update on wedding planning.

00:01:06.204 --> 00:01:08.164
Bad news: the cake vendor canceled.

00:01:08.164 --> 00:01:10.166
Good news: I already found a backup.

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:11.167
Lifesaver.

00:01:11.209 --> 00:01:12.877
When can we do a tasting?

00:01:12.877 --> 00:01:14.087
Saturday at 11 a.m.

00:01:14.087 --> 00:01:17.090
works for both of you.

00:01:23.304 --> 00:01:24.138
Hey there.

00:01:24.138 --> 00:01:27.517
Your website is updated
with the new designs for the fall drop.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.311
Check it out.

00:01:31.437 --> 00:01:32.105
Nice.

00:01:32.105 --> 00:01:32.939
I like that.

00:01:32.939 --> 00:01:36.275
Just swap the first and
third photo, and then you can publish the site.

00:01:36.609 --> 00:01:39.320
Done, you’re live.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.072
Your board meeting deck is ready.

00:01:41.072 --> 00:01:44.784
Product use is climbing
and revenue’s up 51% year over year.

00:01:44.826 --> 00:01:47.995
Okay, this looks good except for - change it

00:01:47.995 --> 00:01:51.499
so that the consumer experience is first
and then get into the growth numbers.

00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:52.417
How's it looking?

00:01:52.417 --> 00:01:56.295
The rebuild is faster
in testing, with no regressions found so far.

00:01:56.295 --> 00:01:58.506
The preview and results are in the PR.

00:01:58.506 --> 00:01:59.132
Amazing.

00:01:59.132 --> 00:02:02.218
Share the results with the team on slack
and get the staged rollout

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.469
ready for my approval.

00:02:03.469 --> 00:02:05.346
I'll flag anything that changes.

00:02:05.346 --> 00:02:09.267
Also, I booked the kids’ after-school lessons as soon as registration opened.

00:02:09.308 --> 00:02:10.768
They’ll love that. Thank you.

00:02:10.768 --> 00:02:13.521
Tomorrow's finance review
just got moved to the same time

00:02:13.521 --> 00:02:16.524
as your daughter's recital,
so I'm going to see if we can reschedule.

00:02:16.524 --> 00:02:17.984
Okay, Yes, please.

00:02:17.984 --> 00:02:20.069
I can't miss that recital.

00:02:20.069 --> 00:02:22.572
All set.
I'll start prepping your notes now.
